{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S01、S04、S10等段落的感受提示偏密，部分比Y更容易让人来不及消化；S13对“明知没人能保证永远”的心理矛盾也不如Y表达得直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的加亮词让人不用逐字读完就能抓住每段心理变化，感受字缩小并按音乐进程出现，也减少了同时面对一大堆短词的负担。人物从小心试探、逐渐放松、害怕失去到接受不确定性的变化，在X里更容易被连续捕捉；感受描写也更贴近声音、身体和情绪的细微变化。不过Y的完整叙述在交代人物动机和心理因果时更顺畅，尤其S13对想要永恒保证却知道无法得到保证的矛盾，表达得比X准确。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "070a5b7c-379f-4e8d-9e39-e5908cd36679", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T045523447076Z", "elapsed_seconds": 105.562, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:57:09.020590+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fabc402c491f66ba69566a1f828f12b85f38471d098c1a8a34ade16f33b86f08", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\